          "tz": 600
        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: fix lod_mirror_test crashes and test logic bugs",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: fix lod_mirror_test crashes and test logic bugs\n\n- mirror_test_setup() and friends: memset() zeroed the already-\n  initialized mtc_env, corrupting lc_remember and LBUG-ing in\n  lu_context_fini() on module exit. Use\n  offsetof(struct mirror_test_ctx, mtc_env) as the memset length,\n  matching resync_test_setup().\n\n- resync_test_setup(): lti_comp_idx pointed at a struct-embedded array,\n  but lod_key_fini() unconditionally frees it, corrupting the slab\n  allocator. Allocate it with OBD_ALLOC_PTR_ARRAY() instead.\n\n- lod_prepare_resync_no_overlap_test: fix the query extent so the test\n  actually exercises the non-overlap skip path.\n\n- Add coverage for lod_layout_convert(), lod_layout_repeat_comp() and\n  lod_comp_copy_ost_lists(), exporting them for test use.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I2f36e9cb91c40b2f5c159b98889ce74457b9c8ef\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
